through  the  file  to  find  out about the existing printers and
prints any files left after a crash.  It  then  uses  the  system
calls and to receive requests to print files in the queue, trans‐
fer files to the spooling area, display the queue, or remove jobs
from the queue.  In each case, it forks a child to handle the re‐
quest  so  the  parent  can continue to listen for more requests.
